---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Virtual Learning" description="Virtual HCA and specialty training via RingCentral and Google Classroom at Headway Nursing Services.">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-900">Virtual Learning</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600">
      Headway Nursing Services offers virtual classes for select courses. Per WA State DSHS, virtual
      learning means synchronous, instructor-led, remote learning conducted in real time.
    </p>

    <section class="mt-8 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-brand-800">Available virtual courses</h2>
      <ul class="list-inside list-disc space-y-1 text-slate-600">
        <li>75 Hour HCA Course</li>
        <li>Dementia Specialty Training</li>
        <li>Mental Health Specialty Training</li>
        <li>CPR / First Aid Training (renewal only)</li>
        <li>Nurse Delegation</li>
        <li>Nurse Delegation — Diabetes</li>
        <li>Orientation and Safety</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-10 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-brand-800">How it works</h2>
      <ol class="mt-4 list-inside list-decimal space-y-3 text-slate-600">
        <li>Set up a Gmail account (required for Google Classroom and Google Forms).</li>
        <li>Register for your class(es) — submit a separate registration for each class.</li>
        <li>Attend live sessions via <strong>RingCentral</strong> video conference.</li>
        <li>Complete modules and exams posted in <strong>Google Classroom</strong>.</li>
        <li>Present picture ID for verification (in-person or scheduled video meeting).</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-10">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-brand-800">Certificates</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600">
        Certificates are awarded through email, mail, or in person by appointment after completion
        and verification.
      </p>
    </section>

    <p class="mt-8">
      <a href="/courses" class="font-semibold text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-800">Browse courses and register →</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
